      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i woke up this morning and the left side of my face feels really weird. like it's drooping a bit and i cant really close my eye all the way on that side. is this like bells palsy or should i be worried about a stroke? it doesnt really hurt just feels heavy and stuck",
