    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's a relief to hear it might just be bells palsy. i've been feeling pretty anxious about it. since it's likely just a nerve thing, do u think i can just wait a few days to see if it gets better on its own? i really dont want to go to the er if i dont have to, it's so expensive and a huge hassle.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
