    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i think i'll try the warm compress thing tonight. but just to be safe, if i do decide to wait, what exactly should i be looking for that would mean it's a real emergency? like, if i keep feeling this way but nothing else changes, am i fine? i feel okay otherwise, no headache or anything.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
